+
+		L_var2 = 32 bit long signed integer (Word32) whose value falls
+				 in the range : 0x8000 0000 <= L_var1 <= 0x7fff ffff.
+
+		pOverflow = pointer to overflow (Flag)
+
+	 Outputs:
+		pOverflow -> 1 if the 32 bit add operation resulted in overflow
+
+	 Returns:
