+------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ INPUT AND OUTPUT DEFINITIONS
+
+ Inputs:
+	lsp_old -- array of type Word16 -- LSP vector at the
+									   4th subfr. of past frame (M)
+	lsp_mid -- array of type Word16 -- LSP vector at the 2nd subfr. of
+									   present frame (M)
