+ FUNCTION NAME: energy_new
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ INPUT AND OUTPUT DEFINITIONS
+
+ Inputs:
+	in = input signal
+	l_trm = input signal length
+	pOverflow = address of overflow (Flag)
+
+ Outputs:
+	pOverflow -> 1 if the energy computation saturates
+
+ Returns:
+	s = return energy of signal
